node_modules/
dist/
*.log
.env
*.db
.buffconfig.json
.npmrc
# Generated addon builds (agent output during addon-creation tasks)
addon/
# Local issue tracking (not synced to the upstream repo)
issues/

# ── Markdown docs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Only the docs PUBLISHED at the website (user-clickable links referring to
# GitHub) are tracked. All other .md files stay local — what appears on
# GitHub is decided per-file. The whitelist below is the published set:
#   * README.md / CHANGELOG.md (repo + npm landing docs)
#   * the 9 docs README.md links to (DESIGN_DECISIONS, ARCHITECTURE,
#     ARCHITECTURE_DIAGRAMS, PRODUCT_STRATEGY, PITCH_DECK, CONTRIBUTING,
#     UPGRADE_ROADMAP, MODELS_EXPLAIN_DEMO)
#   * docs/benchmarks/* (benchmark reports linked from README)
#   * packaging-required READMEs (sdk package, vscode extension + its changelog)
*.md
# Root-level published docs (anchored — a bare `!README.md` would also
# un-ignore tests/README.md, examples/mcp/README.md, etc.)
!/README.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/DESIGN_DECISIONS.md
!/MODELS_EXPLAIN_DEMO.md
!/ARCHITECTURE.md
!/ARCHITECTURE_DIAGRAMS.md
!/PRODUCT_STRATEGY.md
!/PITCH_DECK.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/UPGRADE_ROADMAP.md
!docs/benchmarks/INDEX.md
!docs/benchmarks/m2b-*.md
!docs/GATEWAY.md
!docs/ASSESSMENT_CAPABILITY_GAPS.md
!docs/IMPLEMENTATION_BRIEFS.md
!docs/DASHBOARD_FIRST_PLAN.md
# Machine-derived CLI surface (generated from the live commander tree by
# scripts/generate-commands-surface.mjs, drift-guarded in CI) — a doc that is
# CODE-adjacent build output, not hand-written prose.
!docs/COMMANDS_SURFACE.md
# The default skill registry (.agents/skills/) — SKILL.md files are CODE
# artifacts served by the registry, not user docs. Generated + committed via
# scripts/sync-hub-skills.mjs so the configured default registry resolves.
!.agents/skills/**/SKILL.md
!.agents/skills/**/references/*.md
!packages/sdk/README.md
!vscode-extension/README.md
!vscode-extension/CHANGELOG.md

# Book (internal document — not published)
book/

# macOS
.DS_Store
src/file.ts
src/example.ts
src/fresh.ts
src/forwarded.ts
src/a.ts
src/b.ts
